{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40846","headline":"咏手二首 一 · 赵光远","name":"咏手二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妆成皓腕洗凝脂，背接红巾掬水时。\n薄雾袖中拈玉斝，斜阳屏上捻青丝。\n唤人急拍临前槛，摘杏高揎近曲池。\n好是琵琶弦畔见，细圆无节玉参差。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}